OL,3,GNEWSAGreens aim for first London MP in
OL,4,AHolborn race
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 8 October, voters in the Holborn and
OL,7,FSt Pancras constituency will choose
OL,8,Ftheir next MP.
OL,10,FA win in this seat, which has returned
OL,11,FLabour MPs for decades, would be a
OL,12,Ffeather in the cap of the Green Party
OL,13,Fafter Sir Keir Starmer stood down from
OL,14,Fthe House of Commons at the start of
OL,15,FSeptember, shortly after leaving office
OL,16,Fas prime minister.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
