OL,3,GNEWSAGreens aim for first London MP in
OL,4,AHolborn race
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour are confident of holding on, but
OL,7,Fthe Greens also have high hopes of
OL,8,Fwinning their first London seat - and
OL,9,Fthere are 13 other candidates in the
OL,10,Fmix all hoping to take this central
OL,11,FLondon constituency.
OL,13,FBBC London spoke to five of the leading
OL,14,Fcandidates.
